Server init.
>> a := Blob nouvo: 4.
a bytes: ( Lis nouvo ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob nouvo: 4.
b bytes: ( Lis nouvo ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a nouvo.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Sòti ekri: ( a ^ c ), nouvo-liy. } trape: { :e Sòti ekri: e, nouvo-liy. }, lanse.
a libere.
b libere.
